Z||000004||Slammed Fiero||08-14-2001||08:32 AM||||A local street racer monkey with a 90 5.0ltr wanted to race me. His Girlfriend was in the car with him..Light to light , I beat him every time(he has a 2.?? rear axle and no posi)the car like most mustangs in my area is pieced together ,out of other mustangs and not driven by the most reputable person. (beat him by a wide margin , but since the car isn't the best example of a 5.0ltr , it's not worth bragging about)<P>In anycase , His girlfriend kept saying , I love you car..I love your car , I want to ride in his car Curnie (yes his name is Curnie like the simpsons) He was cool , didn't take any offense , I'm suprised at how many women do like my car...probably becuase they don't know it's a Pontiac.<BR>Honda guys don't like it when there Girlfriends look at my car...they think they have to race me. Well Guys in General don't. <P>JM ||||reg||1
