Z||000018||FieroHeather||08-15-2001||10:35 PM||||Hey Now!!  I currently drive my parents mini-van and they kick some serious @$$!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I absolutely love beating people off of the line in it.<P>As for fieros--they are very pretty cars.  A friend of mine introduced me to them, and I have appreciated the "p" body ever since  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  The best part is cruising along a waterfront--doesnt matter which waterfront (Wasaga, Kempenfelt, Lakeshore/Beach Rd...) tis fun all the same.  <P>I dont know if I'd ever be able to afford a Fiero, but I really like them  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
